  "bio": "Nataliya K is an exceptionally skilled minimalist tattoo artist based in Los Angeles, United States. Renowned for their precision and artistic flair, they have become a sought-after name in the tattoo community. Beyond their considerable talent, Nataliya is also celebrated for their profound professionalism, offering permanent makeup services to individuals with medical conditions at no charge, a testament to their compassionate ethos and dedication to their craft.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Los Angeles, California, United States"
